{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "105", "x": 0.8953504215774838, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03839282702615196, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "[ Examiner's comments]", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.2555179699074907, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Here is the examiner's comment:", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.33792801476933476, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "This response does present data for each of the charts, and generally answers the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.826382218359082, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "question. There is limited detail though, for example, when describing the pie", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.8258812814347917, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "chart for the age of library members, we are told that the members are mostly", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.23636822431373095, "w": 0.8265194992722266, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "adults, and those 65 and over are the [rawest]. There is no mention of children and", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.26469857438786853, "w": 0.8262951746733017, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "young adults, and no reporting of the data in the pie chart itself. This means that", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2930660423122369, "w": 0.8259901629357324, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "only limited details are presented.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.32139637352567824, "w": 0.35062706312246106, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Ideas are organised, and there is an underlying sense of meaning but some lack", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3497267990426009, "w": 0.8259029142000445, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "of progression. Sentences are not fluently linked to each other. Cohesive devices", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3780571491167385, "w": 0.8267528460670864, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "tend to be overused [which I Both I such as I However I Unfortunately I", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.40638753691226864, "w": 0.826055471331306, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Nevertheless], and some are faulty [ Wheras / Whereas]. There is some reference", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4347178869864063, "w": 0.8261341079708743, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "[It], but this is used repetitively, especially in the last paragraph.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4630482747819364, "w": 0.6532709868836751, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "There is an attempt to use a range of vocabulary [less popular I visualisation's I", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.49140337008956114, "w": 0.8259248545401586, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "break new record]; however, overall, the frequency of error, and the mistakes in", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5197337201636988, "w": 0.82623827332394, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "word choice [rawest / lowest I binding /?] limit the score for vocabulary. The range", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5480641079592289, "w": 0.8261859855974996, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "of grammatical structures is also limited. The response should be written using", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5763944580333665, "w": 0.8259464873054115, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "past tenses, as the data covers 2007 to 2016, but is mostly written in the present", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6047248458288966, "w": 0.8263288028581497, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "tense. Sentences are generally short, and the level of error is noticeable for the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6330551959030343, "w": 0.8258378108543784, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "reader.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6612743433120499, "w": 0.07704306858006937, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "This response could be improved by including an appropriate overview, and", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6896046933861876, "w": 0.8260986343368578, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "providing greater accuracy across vocabulary and grammatical structures.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7179351189031102, "w": 0.7669577298842709, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Example overview", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7745958190513854, "w": 0.19435811843334078, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "In Little Chalfont Library, 2016, the majority of members were adults, with the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8029261691255231, "w": 0.8260552662813984, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "most loans in the fiction category. Overall, from 2007 to 2016, loans increased to", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8312565191996607, "w": 0.8260116931760313, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "their highest level across the 10-year period shown.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8596116899500704, "w": 0.5258269329567797, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Great composition [Candidate composition]", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8885353220856188, "w": 0.45692224394725994, "h": 0